  "2026-11-05T05:17:31.869Z",codex-agent,"Additional same-class self-review finding: reserveSearchCapacity uses shared approval assertions, so malformed/missing meta-budget data could escape the proposer as a raw AssertionError. Added a narrow proposerApprovalRead boundary around approval/resource/reservation reads and writes, preserving existing typed capacity and SDK conflicts while returning proposer_approval with Decision/capacity-receipt recovery instructions for raw verification failures. Added a real non-git tracker regression covering malformed approval JSON, missing declarations and negative meta capacity before effects. The first npm gate attempt passed policy 31/31 and all pre-coverage checks, then was intentionally stopped when this further fix was identified; it is superseded evidence and not a complete gate. Will rerun the focused proofs, linked tests and both full gates after this final change."
